<title>USA: Signature Resorts closes acquisition.</title>
<headline>Signature Resorts closes acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Signature Resorts Inc said it had closed its $59.1 million acquisition Plantation Resorts Group Inc, a developer, owner and operator of vacation ownership resorts.</p>
<p>Under the deal 2.4 million shares of Signature stock were issued. Signature stock closed Thursday at 24-5/8. The merger is being treated as a pooling of interests.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
